menu "Kid pet server"

    config KID_PET_SERVER_ORIGIN
        string "PetLearning server origin"
        default ""
        help
            https://host[:port], no path. The server needs a domain name and a
            certificate from a public CA (the firmware checks the chain and
            the host name; plain http is refused). Empty = not configured:
            the parent entry shows "no server". NVS kid_srv/origin overrides
            this value. A paired token is bound to the origin it was issued
            for; changing the origin asks for pairing again.

endmenu
